+# e) Visual observability
+#    The variant is visible without reading color ids: the table looks like four
+#    horizontal color stripes crossed with four vertical shape families. A
+#    successful row query shows four same-colored glyphs; a successful column
+#    query shows four identical silhouettes in different colors.
+#
+# f) Visual cleanliness
+#    No new markers are added. The only highlighting remains the original green
